{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000032766","bookName":"El Diablo solo me desea","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000032766/42000032766.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1272562,"followCount":24323,"introduction":"Lilia Castillo viaja a Villa Plata para reunir dinero para la cirugía de su abuela enferma. En el tren conoce al temido jefe criminal Alejandro Vargas, que se enamora de ella tras curarle las heridas. Obligada a casarse para salvar a su abuela, Lilia confunde a otro hombre con su salvador de la infancia. Poco a poco descubre que él es quien la rescató. Tras enfrentar intrigas familiares y peligros, superan todo y viven su amor verdadero.","chapterCount":73,"labels":["Forced Love","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Forced Love","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-Diablo-solo-me-desea","bookNameLower":"el-diablo-solo-me-desea","shelfTime":"2026-11-08 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-11-08 10:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701910970","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/07/6x6/66x7/667x2/66723000024/701910970_1/701910970.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795208400&Signature=KFQkXhX6Cm6879YSDYwYTsolOLPx74x-6P-fP5SO1eKZkBxFXShcHOaEksrA1xQAfxcdPWHT5Kc8wgNMZmUyikqP3kPawvL7PMANRdfGfa34O1WYS9KMOfdmYPREBAvGkNvspHbV8NwUQVtZHVv4zD~4kjCcu4-fRLXyYZLa52CttRI-y2eQry15FjB2jQ6qx0~G3QW7zU1N145i~FpQQUg4hI2ngkE60lM5oBUbBjf9nnkBFQbOWokw9LEoGqLxIGaJJjTkNdeR8I15RhRf4Z2FRrm9doYsmsqWGh5urIZvabWmrrG8oFLyY-TyHzVbqvY~cc0a~2YVlyZmRgKeqw__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/07/6x6/66x7/667x2/66723000024/701910970_1/701910970.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":156971,"price":0},{"id":"701910971","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/17/6x6/66x7/667x2/66723000024/701910971_1/701910